## Selection rules
- Select a package only when the requested app clearly needs its capability — zero is a common, correct answer.
- Select several when the app genuinely needs several capabilities.
- Reach for React and browser APIs first; add a package only when it removes real work.
- Read the user's intent in whatever language the request is written in.
- Return an empty list when the base stack already covers the request.

